Board Meeting Intimation for Consideration Of Financial Results Of The Company For The Quarter And Financial Year Ending 31St March, 2023 And Recommendation Of Final Dividend, If Any, For Financial Year Ending 31St March, 2023. A. ASIAN PAINTS LTD.has informed BSE that the meeting of the Board of Directors of the Company is scheduled on 11/05/2023 ,inter alia, to consider and approve 1. audited standalone financial results of the Company for the quarter and financial year ending 31st March, 2023;
2. Approval of audited consolidated financial results of the Company for the quarter and financial year ending 31st March, 2023; and
3. Recommendation of final dividend, if any, for the financial year ending 31st March, 2023. Corporate Action-Board to consider Dividend. A. This is to inform you that a meeting of the Board of Directors of the Company will be held on Thursday, 11th May, 2023, inter alia, to consider recommendation of final dividend, if any, for the financial year ending 31st March, 2023.

